        Total # of inputs        : 2
        Total # of product terms : 2
        List of special equations: 
            Clock  = (Net_7639) => Global
            Cpt0 Equation   = (\FracN:frac_0\ * \FracN:acc1_0\)
            Cpt1 Equation   = (!\FracN:frac_0\ * !\FracN:acc1_0\)
